    "description": "Title\n: Vtg Hand Carved Briar Wood Ashtrays Pipe Stands Ornate Indian Chief Set 2 Pieces\nColor\n: Brown\nMaterial\n: Briar wood, glass (inset on larger ashtray)\nDepartment\n: Collectibles > Tobacciana\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nType\n: Hand Carved Briar Wood Indian Chief Ashtrays\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nApproximate measurements (inches)\n: 13L x 5W x 7H\nWeight (approximate)\n: 4.75 lbs\nDescription\n: Distinctive hand-carved briar wood ashtrays, crafted with detailed art that makes each piece unique. The set includes two separate ashtrays: the larger tray features intricate oak leaf and acorn motifs around its border, a segment for matches or cigars, and a glass ash bowl inset with a leaf design at the base. Its centerpiece depicts a portrait of a chief with a headdress. The smaller companion piece also displays elaborate carving, including a similar chief profile and landscape scenes on the sides. The compartment lids on the smaller tray open to reveal storage, perfect for matches or small accessories. Both trays show a warm brown finish highlighting the wood grain and the crisp carving details. Some age-typical wear and patina are visible, as is light soiling in carved recesses and minor rubbing on corners. Overall, these ashtrays are visually striking and reflect classic craftsmanship, making them ideal display accents or collector's pieces for tobacciana or rustic decor themes.",
